      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just need more graphics options, I use VRHigh for lods and shadows but I don't want to lose 50% of performance of 8x anti aliasing I don't need nor want.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-07T00:23:44.700Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know you have options with avatars, but i would like even more options. for example, in world effects like shaders, lighting (switch between realtime, baked or off) and particles (full, reduced, minimum or off). And lastly; if you could remove the prompt that says \"please upgrade your graphics drivers\", that would be fantastic. because some of us are using outdated graphics cards that the developers are no longer updating (like me). And I get it, I'm poor, shut up about it. \n\nThank you for your consideration",
